Scope
=====

The MIT license below covers the source code in this repository: everything
under `src/`, the root-level `run_full_pipeline.py` and `test_assertions.py`,
and the build files `pyproject.toml` and `requirements.txt`.

It does not cover the following, and nothing in it should be read as granting
rights over them.

`data/`, and every file in `results/` except those named `andy_*`
    The frames' AI Hub file names, the keypoint map, the estimator-error summary
    and the result files derive from the AI Hub dataset "Artificial Intelligence
    Data for Preventing Musculoskeletal Burden Factors in Manufacturing Workers"
    (AI Hub dataset 71439), which the
    National Information Society Agency (NIA) of the Republic of Korea
    distributes through AI Hub. Their use is governed by the AI Hub usage policy
    (https://www.aihub.or.kr/intrcn/guid/usagepolicy.do), not by this license.
    That policy requires every use of the data, and every work derived from it,
    to state that the data are a result of NIA's project. They are identifiers
    and aggregates, published here so that the results reported in the
    accompanying paper can be checked. No record-level label of the dataset is
    published: `data/aihub/`, where the code regenerates the labels from a copy
    of the dataset, is kept out of the repository.

`results/andy_*`
    These result files derive from the AnDy dataset of Maurice et al., released
    on Zenodo (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3254403) under the Creative
    Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0). Their use is
    governed by that license, not by this one.

`manuscript/`, and the Markdown documents at the repository root
    The manuscript, its bibliography, figure, highlights and parameter file, and
    the README.
    Copyright (c) 2026 Sungwoo Kang. All rights reserved.


